const GRIDNOTES={"1":"Stroll, Sainz and Verstappen were allowed to start after not setting a time within 107% of the fastest Q1 lap.","2":"Albon was sent to the pit lane after his car was modified under parc fermé conditions; he then did not start.","4":"Hadjar was disqualified from qualifying but allowed to race, starting from the pit lane after taking extra power unit elements.","5":"Stroll started from the pit lane after his car was modified under parc fermé conditions, including new power unit elements.","7":"Alonso started from the pit lane after his car was modified under parc fermé conditions.","9":"Gasly: 3-place penalty for impeding in qualifying. Stroll: 10-place penalty for extra power unit elements.","10":"Alonso (20 places) and Hadjar (30 places) sent to the back of the grid. Stroll, Sainz and Norris: 10-place penalties for extra power unit elements.","11":"Hamilton: 3-place penalty for impeding in qualifying. Antonelli: 3-place penalty for not slowing for yellow flags. Pérez started from the pit lane (parc fermé changes).","12":"Pérez started from the pit lane after his car was modified under parc fermé conditions.","13":"Antonelli and Albon sent to the back of the grid for extra power unit elements. Piastri: 3-place penalty for impeding. Alonso and Lawson started from the pit lane (power unit elements).","14":"Bearman and Stroll were allowed to race without a qualifying time. Stroll: 40-place power unit penalty. Sainz: 3-place penalty for impeding. Bearman started from the pit lane (parc fermé changes).","15":"Alonso (30 places) and Stroll (20 places): power unit penalties. Sainz: 5 places for not slowing for yellow flags. Pérez: 3 places for impeding.","16":"Colapinto: 5 places for causing a collision at the previous round plus 10 for power unit elements. Lindblad: 30 places and Hadjar: 5 places for power unit elements.","17":"Russell starts from the back after a 40-place grid penalty for using additional power unit elements. Alonso starts from the pit lane after Aston Martin changed his turbocharger under parc fermé. Stroll starts from the pit lane for a parc fermé breach, as his car was still uncovered in the garage after the post-qualifying time limit. Hadjar starts from the pit lane after Red Bull changed his engine, exhaust and turbocharger; he had set no time in qualifying."};
